[
  {
    "id": 6901001090010,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん！\r\n『W.I.N.G.』優勝、本当におめでとうございます！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "charType": "sub_characters",
    "charId": "staff",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "bg": "00023",
    "bgm": "020",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6901001090010"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090020,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "私も会場で見てたんですけど、\r\n発表の瞬間、思わず大声を出しちゃいましたよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6901001090020"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090030,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "今もまだ興奮しちゃってて、\r\n今日はもう眠れそうにありません！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6901001090030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとうございます、はづきさん！",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6902001090010,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "本当によくやった\r\n期待以上の結果を出してくれたな",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6902001090010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "社長も……ありがとうございます！",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090040,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ふふ。私と社長も会場に来てましたけど、\r\nすごかったですよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6901001090040"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090050,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "優勝したってわかった瞬間、社長が泣いてしまって……\r\nステージをほとんど見れていませんでしたから",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6901001090050"
  },
  {
    "id": 6902001090020,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "こ、こら！\r\n彼の前でそういうことを言うな！",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6902001090020"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090060,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "それだけ優勝したのを\r\n喜んでたってことじゃないですか",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6901001090060"
  },
  {
    "id": 6902001090030,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "そ、それはそうだが……",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6902001090030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "社長、本当にありがとうございます！",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6902001090040,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "……とにかく。もっと礼を言うべき相手、\r\nいや、祝うべき相手がいるんじゃないか",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6902001090040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうですね\r\n今日の主役は、他でもない彼女ですから",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6902001090050,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "なら、私たちのことは気にせず\r\n早く行ってこい",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6902001090050"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090070,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "彼女のこと、いっぱい\r\n褒めてあげてくださいねー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6901001090070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はい！　もちろんです！",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
