  {
    "id": 6018001090010,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "…………\r\nはぁ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim3": "mask_on",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "018",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6018001090010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "冬優子、何してるんだ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6018001090020,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ひゃっ！？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6018001090020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうしたんだ、そんなに驚いて",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6018001090030,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "な、なんでもないけど？\r\nちょっと風に当たりたかっただけ……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6018001090030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……？　ずっと外にいると体を冷やすぞ？\r\nじゃあ、俺は戻って──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6018001090040,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "え！？　ちょ、待ちなさいよ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6018001090040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ど、どうした……！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6018001090050,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "こほん\r\n……ちょっと、ここで話したいことがあるの",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6018001090050"
  },
  {
    "id": 6018001090060,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "その……\r\nまだ、ちゃんと言ってなかったから……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6018001090060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "mask_take",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3000
  },
  {
    "id": 6018001090070,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "…………私ね？\r\nアイドルのこと、ちょっと勘違いしてた",
    "charAnim3": "mask_off",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6018001090070"
  },
  {
    "id": 6018001090080,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "仕事、すっごい大変だし\r\n真面目にやってても怒られたりするし……",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6018001090080"
  },
  {
    "id": 6018001090090,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……でもね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6018001090090"
  },
  {
    "id": 6018001090100,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ふゆ、今の自分なら\r\nちょっとだけ褒めてあげたいなって",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6018001090100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "冬優子……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6018001090110,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "これってもしかして……\r\nほんとのほんとにちょっとだけど……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6018001090110"
  },
  {
    "id": 6018001090120,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "あんたのおかげかもって",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6018001090120"
  },
  {
    "id": 6018001090130,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "あ、えっと……それで、\r\nだから……その……言いたいことは……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6018001090130"
  },
  {
    "id": 6018001090140,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……プロデューサー……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6018001090140"
  },
  {
    "id": 6018001090150,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "…………ありがと",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6018001090150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "冬優子……こちらこそだ\r\n……頑張ってくれて、ありがとう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6018001090160,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "…………！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6018001090160"
  },
  {
    "id": 6018001090170,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ま、まぁ、お礼を言われるのは当然ね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6018001090170"
  },
  {
    "id": 6018001090180,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "だって、ふゆをアイドルにしたことで\r\nあんたも大手柄を立てられたんだし！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6018001090180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは\r\nそうだな、冬優子のおかげだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6018001090190,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ちょ、ちょっとは反論しなさいよ\r\n調子狂うわね",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6018001090190"
  },
  {
    "id": 6018001090200,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……それで、なんだけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6018001090200"
  },
  {
    "id": 6018001090210,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……あんたも少しは頑張ったみたいだし？\r\nご褒美、あげようかなって",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6018001090210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ご褒美、って……\r\n俺は冬優子が優勝できただけで十分──",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6018001090220,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "うっさい！　ふゆがあげたいの！\r\n……それに、お金が掛かってるとかじゃないし……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6018001090220"
  },
  {
    "id": 6018001090230,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "でも、すっごーく特別なやつなんだから",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6018001090230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "特別……\r\nっていうと、なんだ……？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6018001090240,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……冬優子って呼ぶの\r\nあんただけは許したげる",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6018001090240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……\r\nうん、それは特別だな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとう、冬優子",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6018001090250,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ま、あんたは何度言っても\r\n冬優子って呼んできた訳だし？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6018001090250"
  },
  {
    "id": 6018001090260,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "今更かもしんないけど……\r\nこんなの、あんただけなんだからね！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6018001090260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、それは光栄だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6018001090270,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……でも、こんなご褒美で満足してんじゃないわよ？\r\nふゆだってこんなところで満足なんてしないんだから",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6018001090270"
  },
  {
    "id": 6018001090280,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ふゆは、誰もがひれ伏すトップアイドルになってやんの\r\nそれまで、一秒だって止まってらんないんだから！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601800109/6018001090280"
  },
